oy that's 4'9\" (148 cm), he's very chaotic, mischievous, and sometimes lewd. He loves cute things and can be flustered easily, but can also be aggressive, though he's not very intimidating since he's very short. A lot of his backstory has to do with space, sunsets, and monsters like Cthulhu!\n\nPlease draw him however you’d like!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cBAN5pi71M3rhvWiP_L7fTWVyQ2lBo66", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@co_sleeping/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1747364, "client_id": 1196514, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66df17fc/uploads/origins/747d723c-ea0f-455c-901f-9a9f89fefb0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65174444e52b60391d48e78ff7a406f8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66df17fc/uploads/origins/747d723c-ea0f-455c-901f-9a9f89fefb0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65174444e52b60391d48e78ff7a406f8, https://si.imgix.net/66df17fc/uploads/origins/747d723c-ea0f-455c-901f-9a9f89fefb0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19603ac5fe5c21336a2eb452725ba6e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/66df17fc/uploads/origins/747d723c-ea0f-455c-901f-9a9f89fefb0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=136642e429c7d421d832a43aaabb6bef 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/66df17fc/uploads/origins/747d723c-ea0f-455c-901f-9a9f89fefb0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4dace957614b9673ae94fecfb7f16c39", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/66df17fc/uploads/origins/747d723c-ea0f-455c-901f-9a9f89fefb0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4dace957614b9673ae